WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:07.730
Thanks for the meal!

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:09.650
It was really good!

00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:11.800
Come again sometime.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:14.000
It's fun eating with a big group of people.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:14.410
Okay!

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:15.950
All right!

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:20.380
We'll win the next match so Aki-nee can make us another feast!

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:22.830
Shinsuke, let's do our best!

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:25.040
Yeah!

00:00:25.610 --> 00:00:26.950
Then I'll see you tomorrow!

00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:27.920
Bye-bye!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:28.750
See ya!

00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:41.220
<i>Shinsuke, let's do our best!</i>

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:43.810
That's right.

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:45.400
I need to work even harder!

00:02:24.930 --> 00:02:26.230
Tsurugi Kyousuke.

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:29.280
Are you turning your back against us?

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:33.000
You assisted in Raimon's victory.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:35.130
It was inappropriate behavior as a Seed.

00:02:35.820 --> 00:02:37.140
My apologies.

00:02:38.070 --> 00:02:40.410
If you disobey our orders again,

00:02:40.410 --> 00:02:43.140
your brother will lose his one and only hope.

00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:45.140
Are you okay with that?

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:47.970
I have faith in you.

00:02:48.610 --> 00:02:52.650
Prove to me your true intentions in the next match.

00:02:53.320 --> 00:02:55.030
I understand.

00:02:56.170 --> 00:03:01.060
Then enjoy your soccer, Tsurugi-kun.

00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:09.000
It seems a wind has begun to stir within Raimon.

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:15.110
They are belittling that which must be utmost revered in the youth soccer world, the Fifth Law.

00:03:15.110 --> 00:03:19.210
Shouldn't we be taking down their soccer club as an example to the others?

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:20.750
No.

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:24.110
The Raimon name is a point of admiration for young soccer players.

00:03:24.110 --> 00:03:26.560
Its power of influence is unfathomable.

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:31.650
It would be more beneficial to us if we use this to our advantage instead of destroying it.

00:03:31.650 --> 00:03:34.310
As the Holy Emperor wishes.

00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:44.490
That's...

00:03:46.550 --> 00:03:47.370
Shinsuke?

00:03:49.310 --> 00:03:50.740
What're you up to?{KY \o/}

00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:53.900
Sorry!

00:03:56.370 --> 00:03:57.260
Are you okay?

00:03:57.260 --> 00:03:58.340
Thanks.

00:03:59.150 --> 00:04:01.000
What's that for?

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:04.180
I'm practicing... a hissatsu technique.

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:08.790
I've been thinking about developing my own hissatsu technique.

00:04:09.130 --> 00:04:10.460
Oh!

00:04:10.460 --> 00:04:12.890
I need to work harder, like you.

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:15.810
<i>Soyokaze Step!</i>

00:04:18.740 --> 00:04:22.950
In yesterday's match, I couldn't stop Mannouzaka's attacks.

00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:25.160
<i>I won't let you!</i>

00:04:31.880 --> 00:04:35.460
If I get a hissatsu technique, I'll be more useful to the team.

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:39.310
Then I'll help!

00:04:40.120 --> 00:04:42.840
Let's come up with your hissatsu technique together!

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:44.760
Thanks, Tenma!

00:04:45.410 --> 00:04:47.650
So what kind of technique are you thinking of?

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:50.640
Full Throttle Jump!

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:53.410
Full Throttle Jump?

00:04:53.860 --> 00:04:57.600
My specialties are jumping and headings!

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:02.480
I thought it'd be a good idea to use that to send the opponent's shoots flying back!

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:03.670
I see.

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:05.620
Yeah, that's great!

00:05:08.890 --> 00:05:09.700
Here it comes!

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:20.290
Shinsuke!

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:23.220
I'm fine.

00:05:23.220 --> 00:05:24.940
Keep sending me the ball!

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:27.010
Here's the next one!

00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:28.010
Bring it!

00:05:37.090 --> 00:05:38.350
Bring the next one!

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:41.860
Okay, good! Go right at it!

00:05:45.020 --> 00:05:48.280
Are they all serious about this winning streak?

00:05:48.620 --> 00:05:51.150
All right, next is Formation B!

00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:52.030
Hayami!

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:53.220
Y-Yes!

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:55.660
Pick up the pace!

00:05:56.310 --> 00:05:57.320
Concentrate!

00:05:57.580 --> 00:05:58.170
Okay!

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:03.610
Shin-sama, so dashing.

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:07.090
Say, where's Tenma and Shinsuke?

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:09.970
They're usually here first, but...

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:11.400
I wonder where they went.

00:06:13.140 --> 00:06:13.930
Kirino-kun...

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:16.140
How's the injury on your leg?

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:18.460
It's not anything major.

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:21.400
They said I can start practicing again in two or three days.

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:23.540
That's good to hear.

00:06:23.540 --> 00:06:24.820
But don't overexert yourself before then!

00:06:25.260 --> 00:06:26.320
I know!

00:06:26.970 --> 00:06:28.250
Sorry!

00:06:28.630 --> 00:06:29.660
You're late.

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:31.870
It's my fault.

00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:34.370
We were practicing a hissatsu technique.

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:36.040
Hissatsu technique?

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:37.620
Yes!

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:40.040
I was hoping I could do one like you guys.

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:42.000
What kind of technique is it?

00:06:42.860 --> 00:06:44.700
Um...

00:06:44.700 --> 00:06:46.960
It's a defense technique called Full Throttle Jump.

00:06:47.490 --> 00:06:49.370
Full Throttle Jump?

00:06:49.370 --> 00:06:50.340
What the heck is that?

00:06:50.770 --> 00:06:52.090
Um...

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:54.430
For the time being, it's a technique that uses my jump power!

00:06:55.220 --> 00:06:57.810
It's good that you're motivated, but stay on time.

00:06:58.220 --> 00:06:58.900
Okay!

00:07:00.550 --> 00:07:05.400
Just 'cause you got to show off a bit yesterday doesn't mean you can start slacking off and being late.

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:08.820
Tsurugi's the one who got to show off the most yesterday, but he's not here either.

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:13.980
Maybe he had to take some kind of punishment because he double-crossed Fifth Sector.

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:16.860
And it's not just Tsurugi!

00:07:16.860 --> 00:07:18.790
Who knows what they'll do to <i>us</i> ...

00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:21.100
I'm prepared for anything.

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:25.090
We're going against the Fifth Law on our own will, after all.

00:07:26.160 --> 00:07:28.600
<i>You</i>  might be okay with that, but...

00:07:29.850 --> 00:07:32.590
Um, what's the Fifth Law?

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:34.240
You don't know?

00:07:34.240 --> 00:07:34.760
Yes...

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:37.640
The law of youth soccer, the Fifth Law.

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:42.110
"Soccer shall be loved equally."

00:07:42.110 --> 00:07:46.360
"The value of victory shall be equally distributed."

00:07:47.010 --> 00:07:49.040
The law of youth soccer...

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:52.610
Fifth Sector was created in order to protect that law.

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:57.170
They control the outcomes of the matches and spread out the wins...

00:07:57.170 --> 00:07:59.270
We don't need that kind of soccer anymore!

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:02.250
We're not in the wrong.

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:06.780
We'll keep winning and bring it back.

00:08:06.780 --> 00:08:09.800
Real soccer... with our hands!

00:08:11.450 --> 00:08:13.120
Keep winning, huh...

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:16.180
That's harder than just following score orders.

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:18.310
Yeah, but we have to do it.

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:25.520
What in the world are you trying to do by winning again?

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:27.710
It's the same as I said before.

00:08:27.710 --> 00:08:29.690
I'm only fulfilling my duties as a coach.

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:32.440
Well, your ways are wrong.

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:35.770
Rules exist for a reason, you know.

00:08:35.770 --> 00:08:40.000
All jr. high schools have to abide by the rules of the youth soccer association.

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:44.960
Raimon's consecutive wins are a major violation of the rules.

00:08:45.340 --> 00:08:47.170
I won't be changing my ways.

00:08:48.660 --> 00:08:49.490
Excuse me.

00:08:58.000 --> 00:08:59.510
Ichino? Aoyama?

00:09:00.110 --> 00:09:01.160
What's up?

00:09:01.160 --> 00:09:02.860
We got a little curious.

00:09:02.860 --> 00:09:03.520
About what?

00:09:03.940 --> 00:09:05.280
About Holy Road.

00:09:05.280 --> 00:09:07.730
You guys are fighting for real, aren't you?

00:09:09.340 --> 00:09:09.980
Yeah.

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:11.540
So you are.

00:09:12.250 --> 00:09:13.990
That's a huge undertaking.

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:15.920
Yeah.

00:09:16.870 --> 00:09:18.200
It's sure huge.

00:09:26.970 --> 00:09:28.160
We're starting!

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:28.940
Okay!

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:35.770
Looks like they're all into it.

00:09:36.310 --> 00:09:38.520
They're set on winning the championship.

00:09:38.520 --> 00:09:40.890
They won't get far if they're only half-heartedly doing it.

00:09:41.230 --> 00:09:44.740
The most important part... is having the will to not give up.

00:09:45.240 --> 00:09:47.260
You <i>do</i>  say something nice once in a while.

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:49.980
Shin-sama, you're amazing!

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:51.900
Then again...

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:52.970
Let's go!

00:09:52.970 --> 00:09:53.650
Yeah!

00:09:56.210 --> 00:09:57.370
Hamano!

00:09:58.960 --> 00:09:59.490
Hayami!

00:10:00.010 --> 00:10:00.820
Okay!

00:10:05.260 --> 00:10:06.700
Not going through!

00:10:09.410 --> 00:10:10.330
You're full of openings!

00:10:12.350 --> 00:10:13.880
His charge is so strong!

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:17.500
Amagi-senpai and Kurumada-senpai are both awesome.

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:19.200
I've gotta work hard too!

00:10:21.210 --> 00:10:22.120
Here it comes!

00:10:25.760 --> 00:10:27.180
I won't let you through!

00:10:34.150 --> 00:10:35.130
You...

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:37.650
I've got you!

00:10:41.040 --> 00:10:42.420
I won't lose!

00:10:45.800 --> 00:10:46.760
I did it!

00:10:46.760 --> 00:10:47.620
Not yet!

00:10:48.170 --> 00:10:49.100
How's that?

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:53.100
Why, you...!

00:10:55.650 --> 00:10:56.210
What?

00:10:56.810 --> 00:10:57.640
That's...

00:11:02.830 --> 00:11:04.120
I just...

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:07.900
Yeah, I felt a lot of power there!

00:11:07.900 --> 00:11:08.950
That guy...

00:11:09.790 --> 00:11:12.690
That Shinsuke sure has a lot of guts.

00:11:12.690 --> 00:11:15.150
Yeah, it's impressive.

00:11:15.620 --> 00:11:17.440
Full Throttle Jump, huh?

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:19.440
I'm looking forward to it.

00:11:20.070 --> 00:11:23.400
I'm starting to see my hissatsu technique!

00:11:25.360 --> 00:11:26.600
Inazuma Eleven...

00:11:26.600 --> 00:11:27.260
GO!

00:11:30.770 --> 00:11:32.320
Inazuma Eleven...

00:11:32.320 --> 00:11:33.070
GO!

00:11:37.390 --> 00:11:38.490
I'm heading out!

00:11:38.820 --> 00:11:39.770
Hmm?

00:11:39.770 --> 00:11:41.620
You've got morning practice even on Sunday?

00:11:41.620 --> 00:11:44.270
Nope, I'm training with Shinsuke!

00:11:44.270 --> 00:11:44.840
Training?

00:11:45.530 --> 00:11:48.640
Yeah, the two of us are making a hissatsu technique!

00:11:50.210 --> 00:11:51.750
Makes me remember old times.

00:11:51.750 --> 00:11:52.530
Huh?

00:11:52.530 --> 00:11:55.480
Oh, it's nothing. Do your best!

00:11:55.940 --> 00:11:57.770
Yeah, I'll be back later!

00:11:57.770 --> 00:11:58.980
Have a good time!

00:11:59.640 --> 00:12:01.670
Will things be okay like this?

00:12:01.670 --> 00:12:03.520
Just leave it to me.

00:12:03.520 --> 00:12:05.950
This fish pond is just swarming with 'em.

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:10.090
I wasn't talking about fishing, I was talking about the soccer club.

00:12:10.090 --> 00:12:12.340
Oh, that's what you mean.

00:12:12.340 --> 00:12:13.440
Shouldn't it?

00:12:14.390 --> 00:12:18.820
I'm thinking it won't be so bad to go along with Tenma.

00:12:18.820 --> 00:12:21.460
I'm... not sure about it.

00:12:22.230 --> 00:12:25.600
Hayami... what do you think about soccer anyway?

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:27.480
What's it to you?

00:12:28.610 --> 00:12:33.120
Deep down, I want to play freely, of course.

00:12:33.120 --> 00:12:34.020
Right?

00:12:40.460 --> 00:12:41.190
Here it comes!

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:43.190
Okay, bring it!

00:12:51.820 --> 00:12:52.890
No good...

00:12:53.260 --> 00:12:55.120
Should I kick it lower?

00:12:56.410 --> 00:12:59.610
Not at all! I think I'm almost there!

00:12:59.610 --> 00:13:01.170
Kick it with everything you've got!

00:13:01.170 --> 00:13:03.420
Okay. Then here's the next one!

00:13:12.230 --> 00:13:15.370
It's great that the team's coming together.

00:13:15.370 --> 00:13:16.490
Yeah.

00:13:16.490 --> 00:13:18.400
They all want to win for real.

00:13:18.720 --> 00:13:21.780
Yeah, I can't wait for the next time I can join practice.

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:24.780
Don't rush it. You've still got another two or three days.

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:28.660
But when I see Shinsuke trying so hard, I know I can't fall behind.

00:13:28.930 --> 00:13:30.120
That's true.

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:34.830
We better make sure his efforts help us towards victory.

00:13:35.190 --> 00:13:36.580
I'm counting on you, Captain!

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:38.640
Yeah.

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:43.060
Reach it!

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:44.050
Reach it!

00:13:45.040 --> 00:13:45.880
Okay!

00:13:49.690 --> 00:13:51.370
Yes! I did it!

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:52.880
This is the timing!

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:55.180
Looks great! That was really good!

00:13:55.880 --> 00:13:56.830
Yeah!

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:58.610
Let's try some more!

00:13:59.330 --> 00:14:00.300
Then here I go!

00:14:05.060 --> 00:14:05.940
Now!

00:14:09.160 --> 00:14:10.720
I did it!

00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:11.960
You did it, Shinsuke!

00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:12.900
That was awesome!

00:14:12.900 --> 00:14:15.790
Yeah! My Full Throttle Jump is ready!

00:14:16.900 --> 00:14:18.410
No, it isn't.

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:22.650
Senpai!

00:14:23.120 --> 00:14:25.050
You can't call that ready yet.

00:14:25.520 --> 00:14:28.530
How come it's not ready yet?

00:14:28.530 --> 00:14:32.010
I thought that jumping and timing were the best we could get.

00:14:32.700 --> 00:14:35.000
Is something wrong with it?

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:39.020
In a real match, it's more of a free-for-all in front of the goal.

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:44.930
Unless you can use it with other players around, you can't call it ready.

00:14:44.930 --> 00:14:45.860
I see.

00:14:47.530 --> 00:14:48.820
We'll help you guys out.

00:14:49.860 --> 00:14:54.130
Since we're all third-years, this'll be our last Holy Road tournament.

00:14:54.130 --> 00:14:57.580
We really want to win it, with our own strength!

00:14:57.580 --> 00:15:00.840
Yeah, I realized during the match with Mannouzaka.

00:15:00.840 --> 00:15:03.880
Playing soccer the way you like it is loads of fun!

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:08.860
And if Shinsuke completes this hissatsu technique, it'll make the team stronger.

00:15:09.600 --> 00:15:11.140
Let's complete it together.

00:15:11.870 --> 00:15:12.840
Senpai...

00:15:12.840 --> 00:15:14.350
Thank you!

00:15:20.320 --> 00:15:21.270
Here it comes, Shinsuke!

00:15:21.820 --> 00:15:25.150
Sangoku-senpai's been trained to do all those goal kicks.

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:28.790
If I can't block this, then I can't call it a hissatsu technique!

00:15:28.790 --> 00:15:29.740
Please!

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:30.980
Tenma.

00:15:30.980 --> 00:15:31.910
Okay!

00:15:32.540 --> 00:15:35.040
They're coming... Right? Left?

00:15:35.930 --> 00:15:37.240
This way!

00:15:37.500 --> 00:15:38.410
Sangoku-senpai!

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:47.070
It's here!

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:53.590
Oh no! The timing's off!

00:15:57.600 --> 00:15:58.430
Shinsuke!

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:01.490
Are you okay?

00:16:01.490 --> 00:16:02.440
I'm fine.

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:04.900
Please continue!

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:20.290
Exercise Room

00:16:16.260 --> 00:16:18.390
Yep, that's the way, Yuuichi-kun.

00:16:18.390 --> 00:16:19.050
Okay!

00:16:19.800 --> 00:16:21.410
Good, just a little more.

00:16:25.070 --> 00:16:25.950
Good.

00:16:33.780 --> 00:16:35.560
You're going to play soccer again, right?

00:16:35.980 --> 00:16:36.850
Yes!

00:16:45.050 --> 00:16:48.540
I really can't afford to disobey Fifth Sector.

00:17:01.960 --> 00:17:04.160
It's not working out...

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:06.240
Shinsuke!

00:17:08.820 --> 00:17:10.270
Let's take a break.

00:17:11.530 --> 00:17:13.530
I can keep going. Please!

00:17:14.390 --> 00:17:15.530
Okay then.

00:17:16.240 --> 00:17:17.450
Tenma!

00:17:18.580 --> 00:17:19.800
Shinsuke!

00:17:20.910 --> 00:17:22.650
It's lunch time!

00:17:23.730 --> 00:17:25.400
Thanks for the food!

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:29.470
This is good!

00:17:29.470 --> 00:17:30.210
Right?

00:17:31.050 --> 00:17:34.100
So this is the taste of Aki-nee that you mentioned earlier?

00:17:34.100 --> 00:17:35.160
Yes!

00:17:35.470 --> 00:17:36.510
Did you say something?

00:17:36.510 --> 00:17:38.800
They all say it's really good!

00:17:38.800 --> 00:17:40.890
Oh, eat all you want!

00:17:40.890 --> 00:17:41.900
Okay!

00:17:42.990 --> 00:17:45.480
How's it going? Think you'll finish your hissatsu technique?

00:17:45.480 --> 00:17:47.710
It's still not working out...

00:17:48.510 --> 00:17:52.260
Shinsuke's jumps and headings aren't coming together.

00:17:52.260 --> 00:17:54.640
Jumps and headings...

00:17:54.640 --> 00:17:56.480
Two at once might be overdoing it.

00:17:56.480 --> 00:17:57.560
Overdoing it?

00:17:57.560 --> 00:18:00.220
Are you saying we should just stick to doing one?

00:18:02.240 --> 00:18:06.560
If you get stuck, then you should just think about it in simpler terms. That's all.

00:18:07.170 --> 00:18:08.790
In simpler terms...

00:18:09.140 --> 00:18:12.640
If you use a heading, then you're prone to losing against shoots.

00:18:12.640 --> 00:18:15.440
Yeah, I probably just don't have enough power.

00:18:16.210 --> 00:18:19.100
Then how about using the leg momentum from the jump?

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:21.240
Leg momentum?

00:18:21.880 --> 00:18:23.370
Use a kick to block the ball.

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:27.170
I see, a kick might do it!

00:18:27.390 --> 00:18:28.600
A kick...

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:32.040
But then you'll have to jump <i>even higher</i>  than before!

00:18:36.500 --> 00:18:37.660
I'll do it!

00:18:37.660 --> 00:18:40.550
I'll jump way high up!

00:19:00.440 --> 00:19:02.490
One more, please!

00:19:03.140 --> 00:19:03.770
Yeah!

00:19:04.570 --> 00:19:06.620
You'll get it this time!

00:19:07.090 --> 00:19:08.490
You can do it, Shinsuke!

00:19:09.050 --> 00:19:10.530
I won't give up!

00:19:10.530 --> 00:19:13.210
Tenma's always saying that things will work out somehow, after all!

00:19:15.910 --> 00:19:16.550
Here it comes!

00:19:16.550 --> 00:19:17.410
Okay!

00:19:17.410 --> 00:19:18.430
Yeah!

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:22.890
All right!

00:19:24.770 --> 00:19:26.030
This time...!

00:19:27.120 --> 00:19:30.630
Full Throttle Jump!

00:19:42.490 --> 00:19:43.610
You did it!

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:45.770
You did it, Shinsuke!

00:19:45.770 --> 00:19:46.620
That was it!

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:48.080
Now?

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:50.700
Yeah, you've finally done it!

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:54.410
I did it...

00:19:54.620 --> 00:19:56.090
I did it!

00:19:56.710 --> 00:19:57.860
That was awesome!

00:19:57.860 --> 00:19:59.610
It's an awesome hissatsu technique!

00:19:59.610 --> 00:20:02.470
Yeah! I did it for real this time!

00:20:08.340 --> 00:20:10.000
Thank you so much for everything!

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:11.140
Thank you so much for everything!

00:20:11.470 --> 00:20:15.270
You guys just wouldn't quit no matter how long it took.

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:17.730
I almost thought we had another Tenma with us.

00:20:18.870 --> 00:20:21.440
But that was a really intense kick.

00:20:21.440 --> 00:20:24.700
If that were to come my way, even I probably wouldn't be able to block it.

00:20:25.230 --> 00:20:27.370
Wouldn't that make it a hissatsu shoot?

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:29.540
A hissatsu shoot?

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:30.750
Yeah!

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:33.870
So Full Throttle Jump is a shoot! Yeah!

00:20:34.220 --> 00:20:35.850
You did it, Shinsuke!

00:20:36.980 --> 00:20:40.550
Our team will be even stronger with Shinsuke's hissatsu technique.

00:20:41.080 --> 00:20:43.800
Let's do it. We'll win Holy Road!

00:20:43.800 --> 00:20:44.470
Yeah!

00:20:45.060 --> 00:20:45.680
Yes!

00:20:46.420 --> 00:20:48.640
I'll keep working hard too!

00:20:59.100 --> 00:21:03.160
In order to use the Raimon name and let our power be known,

00:21:03.160 --> 00:21:05.720
I will be giving them a new trial.

00:21:05.930 --> 00:21:07.240
Meaning...?

00:21:08.080 --> 00:21:10.550
I'll have them fight <i>that</i>  man.

00:21:10.550 --> 00:21:11.490
<i>That</i>  man?

00:21:14.890 --> 00:21:17.840
Fifth Sector has given its orders.

00:21:17.840 --> 00:21:20.380
Our next opponent is Raimon Jr. High.

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:21.490
Yes, Commander!

00:21:23.290 --> 00:21:25.450
So this must be fate as well.

00:22:54.120 --> 00:22:56.970
Our next opponent is Teikoku Academy?!

00:22:56.970 --> 00:22:59.970
Raimon's greatest rival finally makes its move!

00:22:59.970 --> 00:23:03.810
Next on Inazuma Eleven GO, 
 The Reunion With Kidou Yuuto

00:23:03.810 --> 00:23:05.360
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:14.910 --> 00:23:17.870
The Inazuma Eleven GO's proverb today is...

00:23:22.860 --> 00:23:26.400
If you get stuck, then you should just think about it in simpler terms.

00:23:26.400 --> 00:23:27.080
That's all!
